---
---

<section class="card focus-card" id="skills">
  <div class="card-header-row">
    <h2>
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="title-icon">
        <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
        <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path>
      </svg>
      Technical Focus & Capabilities
    </h2>
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Engineering Tooling & Stack</span>
  </div>

  <div class="focus-grid">
    <!-- Pillar 1: AI Agents & Epistemics -->
    <div class="focus-col">
      <div class="focus-header">
        <span class="pillar-num">Pillar 01</span>
        <h3>AI Agents & Memory Systems</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="focus-summary">
        Architectures designed for stateful, reliable agent operation and long-horizon task execution.
      </p>
      <div class="focus-items">
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Dual-Brain Epistemics</strong>
          <span>Separation of authoritative repository truth from learned historical guidance.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Prompt Cache Economics</strong>
          <span>Reconciliation of stable prefixes, context compaction, and turn degradation.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Causal Incident Learning</strong>
          <span>Root-cause indexing, symptom linking, and negative-lesson capture.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Three-Axis Verification</strong>
          <span>Authority (candidate/derived/canonical) and validation (unverified/reviewed/verified).</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2: Code Intelligence -->
    <div class="focus-col">
      <div class="focus-header">
        <span class="pillar-num">Pillar 02</span>
        <h3>Codebase Intelligence & MCP</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="focus-summary">
        AST-level code graphs and protocols bridging agent reasoning directly to software structures.
      </p>
      <div class="focus-items">
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Model Context Protocol (MCP)</strong>
          <span>High-performance STDIO JSON-RPC 2.0 transport for agent code tools.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>AST Call-Graph Traversal</strong>
          <span>Multi-hop inbound/outbound caller hierarchies and blast-radius impact analysis.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Hybrid Search & Retrieval</strong>
          <span>FTS5 BM25 lexical search with intent analysis, score breakdown, and graph freshness.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>DeepSeek Harness Integration</strong>
          <span>Native agent plugin hooks, ordered system prompts, and background daemon orchestration.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3: Edge & Systems Infrastructure -->
    <div class="focus-col">
      <div class="focus-header">
        <span class="pillar-num">Pillar 03</span>
        <h3>Cloud, Edge & Systems</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="focus-summary">
        Low-latency serverless edge computing, resilient routing, and native UNIX systems engineering.
      </p>
      <div class="focus-items">
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Cloudflare Workers & V8</strong>
          <span>Low-latency serverless edge execution, Service Bindings, KV, and Cache API.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>Edge Caching & Geo-Steering</strong>
          <span>Tiered cache topologies, stale-while-revalidate, and latency load balancing.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>FreeBSD & Linux Systems</strong>
          <span>rc.d daemon supervisors, system process management, and shell automation.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="focus-item">
          <strong>GitHub Actions Automation</strong>
          <span>Reusable workflows, scheduled maintenance cron jobs, and repository syncing.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .focus-card {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .title-icon {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .focus-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .focus-col {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .focus-col:hover {
    border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
  }

  .focus-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pillar-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .focus-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .focus-summary {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .focus-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .focus-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .focus-col:nth-child(1) .focus-item {
    border-left-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
  }

  .focus-col:nth-child(2) .focus-item {
    border-left-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
  }

  .focus-col:nth-child(3) .focus-item {
    border-left-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  }

  .focus-item strong {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .focus-item span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .focus-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
